SUMMARY:Welcome Home - Ecstatic Dance @WWC w/DJ Bob Swoap
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSaturday\, August 22nd\n\nStude
 nt Orientation Week\nw/ DJ Bob Swoap\n\nIntention: Welcome Home\nPlease pa
 rk in the areas designated by the pins on [this map](https://www.google.co
 m/maps/d/u/0/viewer?mid=1klDVoZpTMeSX6C0--t1XUFJRnRD9fe8&ll=35.61220547678
 6585%2C-82.44113015000002&z=17).\nThere are close locations for those with
  mobility challenges.\n\nWhether you've lived here for years or arrived th
 is week\, tonight is an invitation to feel at home -- in your body\, in mo
 vement\, and among people who love to dance.\nAs part of Warren Wilson Col
 lege's Student Orientation\, this dance welcomes new students while inviti
 ng the greater Asheville dance community to share in the experience. Toget
 her\, we'll create a space where everyone -- new and returning\, student a
 nd local -- can connect through movement.\n\nThis collaborative dance betw
 een AMC and Warren Wilson College's Wilson Ecstatic Dance Student Activiti
 es group is a part of Student Orientation Week.\n\nThanks to the collabora
 tion with Warren Wilson College’s Wilson Ecstatic Dance Student Activiti
 es group\, all Warren Wilson Students & Faculty are invited to attend this
  special event for free. Contributions are still welcomed. Students and fa
 culty please be sure to check the WWC checkbox when signing in. Let your f
 riends know!\n\nPlease contribute up the sliding scale to support AMC!\n\n
 About the DJ\nBob crafts journeys that invite dancers to deeply connect: w
 ith themselves\, others\, nature\, and the music. He layers genres and wor
 ld rhythms into an emotionally engaging set. At Warren Wilson College -- w
 here he is professor of psychology and expressive arts therapy -- Bob faci
 litates ecstatic dance as a part of the community wellness program\, bring
 ing a grounded\, experienced presence to the floor. Favorite place to danc
 e: outside at the WWC Pavilion.\nIG: @bob.swoap\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Ple
 ase note that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Ope
 ning Circle and people who arrive late will be turned away. Please be on t
 ime to ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\n\nTicket Price: $20-40 
 or name your price.\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\
 nPre-registration Recommended:\nhttps://ashevillemovementcollective.org/ev
 ent/\n\nVOLUNTEER!\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Regi
 ster to volunteer at: [https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/]
 (https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CM
 TAAYnJpZBExVTF6aExURExqbndxM3JFUHNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR6
 puHJaet_dJGFESCItA4rMD5vM_RHt9QzUSALulddRTAtGKexRuWuiBE8tDw_aem_vXP_JSWUu1
 NrAFuKa--PQA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\nDoor will close at the beginnin
 g of the opening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH W
 AVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/
 our-dance/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZX
 h0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExVTF6aExURExqbndxM3JFUHNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgy
 MDA4OTIAAR5CSyB7238bGlkEsU_Cg_jsh0446YHLe69W1y3KV5-T6oMaN-7Z3q32wDznUA_aem
 _wUhim1G2JnrnWxIQYKCcIA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective envi
 sions a world that moves in harmony where all are free to be their authent
 ic selves within a loving community. Our mission and aim are to inspire au
 thenticity and healthy community through free-form dance by hosting dance 
 waves for personal and community transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonpro
 fit organization.\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
