SUMMARY:Night Bloom - Ecstatic Dance Wave w/ Jeannie Adair
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, August 28th\nEvening D
 ance Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\nFa
 cilitator Jeannie Adair\n\nIntention: Night Bloom\n\n# **What in you is wa
 iting for the right conditions to bloom?**\n\nSome flowers open only after
  the sun has disappeared.\n\nThey need no instructions.\nThey do not strai
 n toward the light.\nThey simply wait for the conditions that allow what i
 s already within them to unfold.\n\nOn this late August summer night\, let
 's gather to create those conditions together.\n\n**NIGHT BLOOM**\n\nThere
  are flowers that wait for darkness.\n\nAll day\,\nthey hold their fragran
 ce close\,\nasking nothing of the sun.\n\nThen evening comes.\n\nThe air c
 ools.\nThe garden grows quiet.\n\nAnd under the guidance\nof the moon\,\ns
 omething hidden\nbegins to open.\n\nPerhaps something in you\nhas been wai
 ting\, too.\n\nAnd given the fertile dark\,\nthe beckoning moon\,\nthe anc
 ient rhythms\,\nand a body unbound\,\n\nthat bud will remember\nhow to blo
 om.\n\n## About Facilitator Jeannie Adair\n\nJeannie is a mixed media arti
 st\, experience designer & movement medicine evangelist. She curates soulf
 ul journeys that invite emotional release & authentic connection. An AMC f
 acilitator since 2023\, she’s here to hold space with intention\, care\,
  and a loving heart. Find her ecstatic dance mixes on Soundcloud at [https
 ://soundcloud.com/dancingleontine](https://soundcloud.com/dancingleontine)
  and her artwork on Instagram: [https://www.instagram.com/leontine.creativ
 e/](https://www.instagram.com/leontine.creative/)\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* P
 lease note that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at O
 pening Circle and any that come late will be turned away. Please be on tim
 e to ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 
 or name your price.\n\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\nPre-registra
 tion Recommended:\n\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and dance
  for free! Register to volunteer at:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective
 .org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid
 =IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE
 3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1O
 A_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor will clo
 se at the beginning of the opening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPE
 NING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https://ashevillemovem
 entcollective.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-
 dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2
 lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_
 3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Moveme
 nt Collective envisions a world that moves in harmony where all are free t
 o be their authentic selves within a loving community. Our mission and aim
  are to inspire authenticity and healthy community through free-form dance
  by hosting dance waves for personal and community transformation. AMC is 
 a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nLocation: 50 Bell Rd\, Asheville\, 
 NC 28805\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
