DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, August 30th\n1st Dance
  Wave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance W
 ave 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nFacilitato
 r Marta Martín\n\nIntention: Be the Light\nAs we are moving towards short
 er days\, back to school and work or just a time to look inward\; we are i
 nvited to shine our inner light and share it with those who may have lost 
 connection to their own brightness.\n\n## About Marta Martín\n\nMarta (sh
 e/her/ella) has been part of AMC since she moved to Asheville from Surfsid
 e\, FL in 2008. She has been teaching movement for over 30 years\, using m
 usic and movements from around the world.\nShe loves to motivate people to
  find freedom in their bodies so they can dance to the spirit.\nListen to 
 her mixes on Mixcloud ([https://www.mixcloud.com/DancingMarta/](https://ww
 w.mixcloud.com/DancingMarta/) ) and Soundcloud ([https://soundcloud.com/da
 ncingmarta](https://soundcloud.com/dancingmarta) )\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* 
 Please note that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at 
