SUMMARY:AMC Friday Ecstatic Dance LIVE Music w/ Trey Crispin
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, September 11th\nEvenin
 g Dance Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\
 nLIVE Music w/ Trey Crispin and Nata Das\n\nIntention: TBA\n\nAbout the Mu
 sicians:\n*Nata Das is a local Asheville group that has been playing for t
 he AMC for 12 years. We will be using the movements of the dancers present
  to help shape the ebb and flow of this dance. Together we will make a ver
 y interdependent experience that can be very satisfying for all of us.*\n\
 n*Nata Das for this dance is:*\n*Trey Crispin and Friends*\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\
 n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close prom
 ptly at Opening Circle and any that come late will be turned away. Please 
